{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2SA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"撒母耳记下","commonName":"撒母耳记下","title":"撒母耳记下","order":10,"numberOfChapters":24,"sha256":"2a264db417f1763c92ff71ac5282913beefde61284fc2dc01c740071952a99eb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2SA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":24,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2SA/24.json","totalNumberOfVerses":694},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大卫听到扫罗的死讯"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["扫罗死后，大卫击杀亚玛力人回来，在洗革拉住了两天。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["第三天，有一人从扫罗的营里出来，衣服撕裂，头蒙灰尘，到大卫面前伏地叩拜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["大卫问他说：「你从哪里来？」他说：「我从以色列的营里逃来。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["大卫又问他说：「事情怎样？请你告诉我。」他回答说：「百姓从阵上逃跑，也有许多人仆倒死亡；扫罗和他儿子约拿单也死了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["大卫问报信的少年人说：「你怎么知道扫罗和他儿子约拿单死了呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["报信的少年人说：「我偶然到基利波山，看见扫罗伏在自己枪上，有战车、马兵紧紧地追他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他回头看见我，就呼叫我。我说：『我在这里。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他问我说：『你是什么人？』我说：『我是亚玛力人。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他说：『请你来，将我杀死；因为痛苦抓住我，我的生命尚存。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我准知他仆倒必不能活，就去将他杀死，把他头上的冠冕、臂上的镯子拿到我主这里。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["大卫就撕裂衣服，跟随他的人也是如此，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["而且悲哀哭号，禁食到晚上，是因扫罗和他儿子约拿单，并耶和华的民以色列家的人，倒在刀下。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["大卫问报信的少年人说：「你是哪里的人？」他说：「我是亚玛力客人的儿子。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["大卫说：「你伸手杀害耶和华的受膏者，怎么不畏惧呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["大卫叫了一个少年人来，说：「你去杀他吧！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["大卫对他说：「你流人血的罪归到自己的头上，因为你亲口作见证说：『我杀了耶和华的受膏者。』」少年人就把他杀了。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["大卫为扫罗和约拿单作哀歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["大卫作哀歌，吊扫罗和他儿子约拿单，"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["且吩咐将这歌教导犹大人。这歌名叫「弓歌」，写在雅煞珥书上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"歌中说：以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你尊荣者在山上被杀！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大英雄何竟死亡！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在迦特报告；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在亚实基伦街上传扬；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得非利士的女子欢乐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得未受割礼之人的女子矜夸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"基利波山哪，愿你那里没有雨露！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿你田地无土产可作供物！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为英雄的盾牌在那里被污丢弃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"扫罗的盾牌仿佛未曾抹油。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"约拿单的弓箭非流敌人的血不退缩；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"扫罗的刀剑非剖勇士的油不收回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"扫罗和约拿单—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"活时相悦相爱，死时也不分离","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"—他们比鹰更快，比狮子还强。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"以色列的女子啊，当为扫罗哭号！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他曾使你们穿朱红色的美衣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们衣服有黄金的妆饰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"英雄何竟在阵上仆倒！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"约拿单何竟在山上被杀！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我兄约拿单哪，我为你悲伤！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我甚喜悦你！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你向我发的爱情奇妙非常，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"过于妇女的爱情。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"英雄何竟仆倒！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"战具何竟灭没！","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2SA/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2SA/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1SA/31.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}